  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Rainaldus de Pannocchieschis, divina pietate inspiratus, dono et concedo monasterio Sancti Eugendi de Senis pratum meum magnum situm iuxta flumen Arbia, cum omnibus iuribus pascendi et secandi et aquae ducendae, ut monachi fenum colligant pro animalibus suis et pro elemosyna pauperum.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si aliquis ex progenie mea vel alia quaelibet persona hanc cartam donationis violare temptaverit, maledictionem Dei et omnium sanctorum incurrat, et componat monasterio libras septem argenti puri, et nihilominus donatio ista firma permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Iacobus de Bichis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Salimbene filius Ugonis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Gerardus de Cacciacontis</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Rolandus de Goris</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
